### Component 2: Course Authoring Kit

We will build the Course Authoring Kit, which provides content creators with instructions, schemas, templates, and compiler scripts to package courses easily.

#### [NEW] [course_schema.sql](file:///e:/projects/leitner-learning-platform/course-authoring-kit/schema/course_schema.sql)
* DDL script representing the official course database structure.

#### [NEW] [compile_course.py](file:///e:/projects/leitner-learning-platform/course-authoring-kit/tools/compile_course.py)
* A cross-platform Python script that automates the compiling process:
  1. Reads a source course manifest (`manifest.json`) and cards data (`cards.json`).
  2. Populates a fresh SQLite `course.db` database conforming to the schema.
  3. Encrypts referenced image and audio assets using AES-256-CBC.
  4. Packaging of the outputs into a standard zip package `<course_id>.zip`.

#### [NEW] [README.md](file:///e:/projects/leitner-learning-platform/course-authoring-kit/README.md)
* Detailed usage guide for content authors on how to format input files, run the compiler tool, and upload packages.

