## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests
* We will verify the compiled sample database integrity using a test python script that reads the database, validates columns, indexes, and decrypts the encrypted media assets using the same key used for compilation.

### Manual Verification
* Inspect the output structure of the compiled sample course to ensure it precisely matches the standard layout:
  ```text
  course_package/
  ├── course.db
  ├── images/
  ├── audio/
  └── manifest.json
  ```
